SYNOPSIS
	pm - UNIX version of PacMan

INTENDED ENVIRONMENT
	BSD 4.[123]
	BSD 2.[89] PDP 11/70
	SysV

TESTED ENVIRONMENTS
	BSD 4.[12] VAX 11/750
	BSD 2.[89] PDP 11/70

DESCRIPTION
	Pm is a UNIX version of the popular arcade game PacMan.
	This is the second posting of these sources.
	Thanks to everyone who sent bug reports and fixes, all
	portability problems reported thus far should be solved.
	Pm should work for Sys5 and 68000 based machines.  The
	problem where pm was only printing NULLs has been fixed
	as has the "__sobuf" problem.

